1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:05,600
GlancePx is a glance-and-act market ticker for Even Realities G2 glasses.

2
00:00:06,604 --> 00:00:13,406
It is running in the official Even Hub simulator, on the five seventy-six by two eighty-eight monochrome display.

3
00:00:13,356 --> 00:00:19,711
Live U.S. dollar quotes for Bitcoin, Ethereum, Solana, and BNB, from CoinGecko.

4
00:00:20,778 --> 00:00:23,106
Swipe the temple to move the focus.

5
00:00:23,056 --> 00:00:25,806
One glance, four coins, no phone.

6
00:00:26,864 --> 00:00:29,061
Solana, then BNB.

7
00:00:29,011 --> 00:00:32,879
The focused row is marked, and the confirm action follows it.

8
00:00:33,934 --> 00:00:39,289
When a move matters, go back to Bitcoin, and one tap opens a paper price alert.

9
00:00:39,239 --> 00:00:40,357
No typing.

10
00:00:41,412 --> 00:00:44,372
The five percent target is already filled in.

11
00:00:44,322 --> 00:00:47,151
This is a paper alert, on the device only.

12
00:00:47,151 --> 00:00:50,019
No order is sent, and no funds are held.

13
00:00:51,074 --> 00:00:52,652
Tap once to confirm.

14
00:00:52,602 --> 00:00:56,721
The alert is stored on the device, and will flag on the next refresh.

15
00:00:57,784 --> 00:00:59,205
GlancePx.

16
00:00:59,155 --> 00:01:01,562
Track two, Crypto and DeFi.

17
00:01:01,562 --> 00:01:06,155
Built for the Heads Up hackathon, with no API keys and no custody.

